x":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1260011025:0":{"text":"뭐, 뭐라고? 음, 내가 왜... 둥글둥글해진 거지?!","source_cn":"什么，什么？呃，我怎么……圆滚滚的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4361C6ACF75927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:40:1260011025":{"text":"뭐, 뭐라고? 음, 내가 왜... 둥글둥글해진 거지?!","source_cn":"什么，什么？呃，我怎么……圆滚滚的？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4361C6ACF75927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1260011026:0":{"text":"적어도, 적어도 두 분의 요구를 만족시킨 셈이에요, 그럼요!","source_cn":"至少、至少也算满足你们两方的要求了，嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5144B60B09E52489","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1260011049:0":{"text":"효과에 대해선 이미 알고 있었지만, 직접 보니 정말 엄청나네.","source_cn":"虽然已经知道效果，但亲眼看到幻形魔法，仍然震撼人心。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x32B18D0A43C031A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"효과에 대해선 이미 알고 있었지만, 직접 보니 정말 엄청나네.","female":"효과에 대해선 이미 알고 있었지만, 직접 보니 정말 엄청나네.","variant_male_record_index":"140586","variant_female_record_index":"140587","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1260011050:1":{"text":"마법은... 참으로 존경스럽고도 무서운 힘이야.","source_cn":"魔法……是一种可敬又可怕的力量。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA810CDB611542696","variant_status